Review context.
Diff base: a42e8f9d49ac1a6baf94cb38629f07485e1186b5 (the merge-base with origin/main; its commit message describes unrelated earlier work, not this change).
Head: the staged tree 11b7d01d6d53992e9800d427bc66fbf2f8257927 (not yet committed).
Intent of the change: Add a required pre-commit and pre-push review: two read-only reviewer agents (slop-reviewer, defect-reviewer), scripts/precommit-review.sh to run them on the net change and record a verdict per tree, and a Claude Code PreToolUse hook (scripts/precommit-review-gate.mjs) that blocks git commit and git push without a passing verdict made against the current merge-base. AGENTS.md documents the rule.
The staged content is the subject: read a file as staged with `git show :<path>`; the working tree may contain unstaged edits that are NOT part of the change.
Command to read the full diff: git diff --cached a42e8f9d49ac1a6baf94cb38629f07485e1186b5
Command to read one file: git diff --cached a42e8f9d49ac1a6baf94cb38629f07485e1186b5 -- <path>
Read a file as it is at the diff base: git show a42e8f9d49ac1a6baf94cb38629f07485e1186b5:<path>
Repository instructions: AGENTS.md at the repository root.

Changed files (stat):
